<title>MEXICO: Camesa to turn A, B shrs into one series.</title>
<headline>Camesa to turn A, B shrs into one series.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Industrial Camesa (Camesa), steel cable maker and fluorspar miner, will combine its A and B series shares into a single share series beginning on Friday, the company said.</p>
<p>The total number of shares in the new series will be 306.5 million, according to the Mexican stock market, with each share price at 4.372406 pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico newsroom +525 728-9562))</p>
